;--------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------
IF LOCAL
	SELECTCASE ARG:1
	CASE 1
		;特訓を頼まれる
		;～から新技の訓練に付き合って欲しいと言われた
		PRINTFORMW 「Hey %CALLNAME:MASTER%, I wanna try some new techniques, so I want you to help me out.」
		PRINTFORML 「It's better to have a real opponent, y'know.」
		PRINTFORMW 「I dunno, but it feels like I can learn more about magic with you than from books. So, how 'bout it? Wanna give it a shot?」
		PRINTFORMDW Marisa says this casually, but she's using real magic. 
		PRINTFORMDL Any accident could cause a serious injury...
	CASE 2
		;断る
		;～は残念そうだ
		PRINTFORMW 「Eeh? What are you, chicken?」
		PRINTFORMW 「Fine then, I'll practice alone.」
	CASE 3
		;～の攻撃！
		;※ここはWAITしないでください
		PRINTFORMW 「Alrighty, now that's settled the rest is quite simple.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Please stand over there... Yes, right there.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Ok, here I go%K11_ZE()%!」
		PRINTFORMDL Marisa unleashes a barrage of magic projectiles! 
	CASE 4
		IF ARG:2
			;時間停止して回避
			PRINTFORMDL As you stop time, you walk next to Marisa and take her mini-Hakkero before resuming time.
			PRINTFORML 「...Whoa, what the--?! H-How did you get here?!」
			PRINTFORML 「Are you cheating?! You're cheating, right?! No way you can just do that!」
			PRINTFORMW 「Grr... It's okay. I'll come up with something more nasty, you'll see! And give me that back%K11_ZE()%!」
		ELSE
			;回避成功
			PRINTFORMW 「Damn...I didn't hold back, but you avoided it so easily.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I've gotta practice a lot more. But thank you for your help%K11_ZE()%!」
		ENDIF
	CASE 5
		;回避失敗
		PRINTFORMDL Before you can dodge, Marisa's barrage smashes right into you, blowing you away!
		PRINTFORMDW The blow was so strong that you spin in the air a few times before falling to the ground with a thud.
		PRINTFORMW 「Oh, whoah, are you okay?!」
		PRINTFORMW 「Ah, sorry about that... On the bright side, I'm more confident in that attack now. Thanks!」
